Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{INSERT}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Next Episode
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,“…The Searched Item at Dusk.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:27.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san, it’s autumn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:29.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It smells like autumn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:31.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Smells like autumn?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:32.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:36.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a little smoky and sunny,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.13,0:00:40.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,and it makes your chest feel a\Nlittle refreshed, or a little tight…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.79,0:00:43.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a smell that makes you feel all nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:47.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t have your memories, but\Nyou remember the smell of autumn?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.90,0:00:48.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:50.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.73,0:00:53.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:17.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:03:00.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s the first time I’ve ever\Nseen such a great ginkgo tree.{ichou-san}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:04.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It really is autumn, Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.49,0:03:09.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:10.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t look very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:13.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:16.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at this. Do you know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:23.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, when it’s autumn, all the leaves dress up and do a wind dance…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:27.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell kind of fantasy story do you think this is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.89,0:03:30.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! What do you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:32.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.69,0:03:37.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t tell me you forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:41.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There’s a place I want to go to!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:46.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And what do you have to do for that wish to be granted?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:48.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.74,0:03:50.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to gather confetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:52.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you have to do to gather confetti?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:56.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to heal broken hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:58.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How long do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.21,0:04:00.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I have until the end of the four seasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.55,0:04:01.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How many seasons do you have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:03.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:05.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How many do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:06.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:09.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,About this many…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:12.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:13.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:18.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You know where you want to go, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.61,0:04:23.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:26.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.41,0:04:31.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful! You’ll lose your hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.37,0:04:34.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:36.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,For crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.46,0:04:42.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:45.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine then! Toshihiko-kun, I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:50.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What’s wrong? You can’t\Ntell someone you hate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.22,0:04:53.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru-kun and Toshihiko-kun are\Nfighting over wooden building blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:56.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,My train won’t work unless I have triangles,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:05:00.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,but Toshihiko-kun’s using two of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:03.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s because you need two triangles to make a square.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:06.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There aren’t any more square blocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.73,0:05:07.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:14.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, let’s all make something big! Like a castle or…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:15.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t want to anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:27.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you won’t use them nicely, then I won’t let you use them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:31.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:32.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They’re all just boring toys anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.99,0:05:35.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. They’re old and dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:37.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You might as well throw them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, you mustn’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:55.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-sensei, don’t be angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:17.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:23.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:25.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:29.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I heard Ioryogi-san’s\Nvoice, but Ioryogi-san’s not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:30.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:31.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you an idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:34.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This is no time to be moping around!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:37.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think you can gather confetti like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.37,0:06:40.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:43.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:51.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun just left for his part-time job, but did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:55.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s unusual for him to leave without saying goodbye. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:58.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:00.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:04.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:07.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So that’s what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:12.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san didn’t get angry, but he looked so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:15.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t realize that…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:20.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s not your fault, Kobato-chan. Or Fujimoto-kun’s.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.33,0:07:24.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The children put up with a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:28.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’d like to give them new toys and provide them with more, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:31.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Toys…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.09,0:07:34.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! I know a good place for toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.35,0:07:36.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A good place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:43.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:44.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Someplace fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.73,0:07:48.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:50.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a big tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.65,0:07:55.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re going to gather fallen leaves today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.03,0:07:59.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then we’ll bring them back\Nand make pictures out of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.41,0:08:01.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:05.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fallen leaves have all sorts of colors and shapes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:09.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of picture can you make?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.88,0:08:12.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to get some!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:27.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei, look! It’s a pretty leaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:29.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,My.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:31.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This is for you, Sayaka-sensei. {Wow this kid’s voice…}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:33.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:34.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can have this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:38.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.45,0:08:43.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, about the wood blocks…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:48.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you promise to use them nicely?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:49.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:50.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll use them nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:52.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And also…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There’s something you need to say after a fight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:58.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:00.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:03.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And don’t forget to apologize to Fujimoto-kun too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:04.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:06.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll get lots of leaves to give to Kiyokazu-sensei too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.36,0:09:12.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s good, they made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:17.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They usually never fight…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:21.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess the anxiety of the adults really affects them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:26.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No! Sayaka-sensei, a smile suits you much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:29.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:33.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A sad face will never find happiness, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:36.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, a smile! A smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:52.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing, it’s as if it’s burning with light.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:54.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:07.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Somehow, it makes me feel purified and at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:25.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Move back! It’s dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:32.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, what’s happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:36.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re cutting down that tree tomorrow, so we’re setting up a fence today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.40,0:10:40.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re cutting down the ginkgo tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.41,0:10:42.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:46.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The neighbors are complaining about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:48.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They say it’s in the way, so\Nsomething needs to be done about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:51.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But it’s so pretty and big.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s too big, so the leaves get everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:58.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we’ll be doing some redevelopment here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:02.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, move along.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:16.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:20.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s redevelopment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:25.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s when they destroy old things like\Nstreets and buildings and put up new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:29.58,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s redevelopment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:30.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:38.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So they can’t keep the old things…\NDoes that mean they don’t need them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:40.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not exactly it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.13,0:11:46.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s just that most people\Nwould rather have newer things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:20.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it isn’t time to go to the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:22.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to ask them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:26.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to ask them to not cut down the ginkgo tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:34.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If I ask them, I’m sure…!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:51.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.12,0:12:58.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato-san, Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:02.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku-san, were you worried about the ginkgo tree too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:07.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Redevelopment is so harsh on old things!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.34,0:13:08.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:12.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But I’ll go ask them, so it’ll be all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.39,0:13:13.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:17.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I have no idea what’s going to be “all right.”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:19.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:22.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This fence wasn’t here yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.36,0:13:25.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,They’re going to be redeveloping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:29.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. Well, they’ve always been talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.45,0:13:36.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s such a great ginkgo tree, but there’s no other choice if it’s for the good of the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:43.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that’s too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.17,0:13:46.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1400)}But it’s good to hear that they’re redeveloping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:51.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There’s such a huge tree here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:53.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn’t a tree that big kind of creep you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.89,0:13:55.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It kind of does. {Yes creepy big trees. Only in japan I suppose.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.10,0:13:58.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, we’re out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.94,0:14:02.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong, Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:03.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.65,0:14:07.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re dissatisfied, aren’t you? Since everyone says they don’t want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:09.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:10.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.53,0:14:15.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m wondering if the ginkgo tree is lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:16.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.21,0:14:22.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s been here for hundreds of years, watching this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:27.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yet no one cares about it…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:01.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll be all right, Kobato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:05.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It says it isn’t lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:13.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You can tell what the ginkgo tree is saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:15.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:19.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She seems like an airhead but she’s still an angel, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.93,0:15:23.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, what else did the ginkgo tree say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:29.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s happy because a bunch of\Nchildren came to play with it yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.84,0:15:31.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It says it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:39.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything else we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:44.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It says “thank you.”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.04,0:15:46.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And also…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.67,0:15:49.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…“farewell.”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.17,0:15:52.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll be all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.13,0:15:54.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll ask them to not cut you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:05.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it’s not hoping for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.61,0:16:11.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll move the ginkgo tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:25.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey. What the heck do you think you’re doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:27.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:30.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But if we don’t…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The ginkgo tree… The ginkgo tree will…!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:46.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,900)}I know a wisteria tree the same age as this ginkgo tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:54.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That wisteria tree said the\Nsame thing as this ginkgo tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:56.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.95,0:17:01.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It said that the most happy thing for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:03.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,was that it could watch over the people it loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:19.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you hear the ginkgo tree’s song?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:27.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.31,0:17:31.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a little sad, but it’s so gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:11.98,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,The ginkgo tree{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.98,0:20:13.64,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,That was dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:15.44,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,What were you just standing there for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:17.06,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:21.49,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,It reached its life span.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.65,0:20:24.45,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,It’s hollow inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.11,0:20:28.33,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Sooner or later, it would’ve withered away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:35.54,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,It hung on for as long as it could.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:39.21,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.05,0:20:43.26,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Was the ginkgo tree happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.26,0:20:45.01,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.01,0:20:46.51,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I’m sure it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.35,0:20:52.27,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,It departed this world after finally hearing your song, Kobato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:04.86,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.91,0:21:09.12,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Where did this confetti come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:13.62,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be from Kohaku-san? But that doesn’t seem right…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.62,0:21:17.00,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san! That can’t be it either…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:18.96,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,It could be from the ginkgo tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.67,0:21:22.67,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Plants are alive too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.67,0:21:26.43,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,So it wouldn’t be unusual to heal them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:30.64,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,But I couldn’t save the ginkgo tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:32.68,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,You sang for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:33.98,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Sang?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.98,0:21:36.14,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Didn’t Kohaku say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.14,0:21:40.02,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,It was able to be sent off by hearing your song.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:42.98,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,It must’ve been pretty happy to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:45.65,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.37,0:21:55.91,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Here, how’s this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:02.17,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, do you want to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:05.51,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Those are…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:12.28,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,These are… wood blocks, aren’t they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.56,0:22:15.06,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,I got some of the ginkgo tree’s branches and made them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.35,0:22:17.94,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,The gingko tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.31,0:22:24.48,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing! You’re amazing, Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.48,0:22:25.86,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,It’s nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.86,0:22:30.32,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, Fujimoto-san’s making more wood blocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.20,0:22:37.04,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko-kun, Yuzuru-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:40.21,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx90\}don’t you have something to say to\NFujimoto-san before you play with the blocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.29,0:22:44.55,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-sensei, we’re sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.55,0:22:45.40,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:48.26,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,That’s good. Now you’ve all made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.26,0:22:51.89,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey, Kiyokazu-sensei,\Ncome make leaf pictures with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.89,0:22:52.76,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,No, I’m…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:56.02,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,If you attach a gingko leaf here,\Nyou get a Gingko-Fujimoto Alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.02,0:22:58.84,KM,Dialogue,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1800)}Huh?
